To: {{target}} Support

Hello,

My free trial converted to a paid plan without the clear, conspicuous information and express consent required for a distance contract by electronic means under Article 8(2) of the Consumer Rights Directive (2011/83/EU). {{goal}}

Please point to where explicit consent to be charged was obtained; otherwise I consider that I am not bound by this charge and will seek a chargeback and, if needed, contact the relevant consumer authority.

Sincerely,
{{name}}
